1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,640
Try to catch me !

25
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,790
Here, hurry up !

26
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,590
Don’t worry, Second Brother.

27
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:03,350
One day, Tie Zhu will return too.

28
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:06,470
We’ll throw him an even grander welcome feast.

29
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,270
That kid is Wang Hao, right ?

30
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:10,990
Long time no see !

31
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,360
Wang Hao
Xuan Dao Sect disciple
4th layer of Qi Condensation

32
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:14,830
Wang Hao !

33
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,440
It’s only been a few years since you left for training.

34
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:18,590
You’ve changed so much !

35
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,510
I just trained my alchemy.

36
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,240
If you want to talk about big changes,

37
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,630
Tie Zhu’s cultivation has long surpassed both of ours.

38
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,470
He isn't very talented

39
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:28,280
Wang Zhuo
Xuan Dao Sect disciple
11th layer of Qi Condensation

40
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,870
so even if he works hard he won't get very far.

41
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,950
Alright, let’s not talk about him.

42
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,590
Today, we drink until we drop !

43
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,070
Okay.

44
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,790
Why is the weather changing ?

45
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,000
What’s happening ?

46
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:44,960
Is this a mirror ?

47
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:48,910
Is that an Immortal ?

48
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,720
It really is an Immortal !

49
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,830
I guess he is.

50
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,320
Paying respects to Seniors !

51
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:55,110
I am Wang Zhuo of the Xuan Dao Sect.

52
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,070
I am Wang Hao.

53
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,830
Immortals ! They really are Immortals !

54
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,600
We are holding a feast today at the Wang Family.

55
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,390
May I ask why Seniors

56
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,550
came here ?

57
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:08,270
This old man is looking for someone !

58
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:20,230
So the Corpse Sect sent disciples into Jue Ming Valley

59
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:22,670
and allowed their Corpse Puppets to devour them

60
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:25,190
making them Late stage Foundation Establishment.

61
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,940
This does indeed increase their chances of keeping the token.

62
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:28,580
Late stage Foundation Establishment ?

63
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:31,470
I wonder what kind of artifacts you have

64
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,670
since you managed to escape.

65
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,270
Please Immortal, bless us !

66
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:03,270
Immortal, bless us !

67
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,640
What’s happening ?

68
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:07,830
What is this ?

69
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,840
Something’s wrong...

70
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,230
Your close relatives

71
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,470
are connected by blood.

72
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,470
Fellow cultivator Teng...

73
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:19,230
It’s not too late to stop now.

74
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,230
Li’er is already dead.

75
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,550
It's too late to back down !

76
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,430
Found him !

77
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,600
The Wang Family Village ?

78
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,880
Father ! Mother !

79
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:38,470
Tie Zhu ?

80
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,070
Why is Tie Zhu here ?

81
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,070
It’s Tie Zhu...

82
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,110
Tie Zhu !

83
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,790
Wang Lin...

84
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,640
You’re Teng Huayuan !?

85
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:05,870
What do you want !?

86
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,150
What do I want ?

87
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,350
Blood for blood.

88
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:14,350
I will wipe out your Wang Family to avenge my grandson Teng Li !

89
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,990
What is this ?

90
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,120
Don’t touch it !

91
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:49,670
Stop !

92
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,350
Immortal !

93
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,390
How has our Wang Family offended you ?

94
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:56,510
Why is this happening ?

95
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,070
Why ?

96
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:02,440
I will not spare a single soul today !

97
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,550
I’m the one who killed him !

98
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,790
I’m the one who stole his cultivation !

99
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,430
I’m in Jue Ming Valley right now.

100
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,550
Now come and kill me !

101
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,070
Teng Huayuan !

102
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,310
If you dare, come and kill me !

103
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,030
Kill you ?

104
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,590
Let's not rush this.

105
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,760
Don’t act rashly, he’s a Nascent Soul old monster.

106
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,510
Stop !

107
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:44,950
Stop now !

108
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,950
They have nothing to do with this,

109
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,230
I’m the one you want !

110
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,870
Teng Huayuan !

111
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,310
Got you !

112
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,870
Tie Zhu !

113
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,670
If you dare, come and kill me !

114
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:06,990
You have nowhere left to run...

115
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,230
Hand over your body now !

116
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:11,190
Come to Jue Ming Valley and kill me,

117
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,150
Teng Huayuan !

118
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,190
Wang Lin dared to kill my grandson

119
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,630
so I'll exterminate his entire family !

120
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,070
Father !

121
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,230
Mother !

122
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,030
Mother !

123
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,760
The Ji Realm ?

124
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,790
Tie Zhu...

125
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:26,990
There is something wrong with this kid.

126
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,070
Fellow cultivator Teng,

127
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,190
leave this one to me.

128
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,920
I have a use for him.

129
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,350
Why are you doing this ? Why !?

130
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,470
We must survive.

131
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:53,270
Only by living can we take our revenge !

132
00:08:57,440 --> 00:09:00,590
You won’t interfere with these two, will you ?

133
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:03,630
Why are you asking when you know the answer ?

134
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,270
If you kill them in front of me,

135
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,710
I won’t stop you.

136
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,630
But if Piao Nanzi asks me,

137
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:14,270
I’ll naturally tell him the truth.

138
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,150
Tie Zhu...

139
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,310
Tie Zhu ?

140
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,200
This bead contains my Divine Sense.

141
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,040
If you’re ever in danger,

142
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,040
you just need to crush it

143
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,390
and I'll come immediately.

144
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,110
Father...

145
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:45,910
Crush the bead I gave you, hurry up !

146
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,430
Hurry up !

147
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,350
My son,

148
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:54,110
no matter what you have done,

149
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,190
you must take care of yourself.

150
00:09:58,040 --> 00:10:00,870
Only then will we be at peace.

151
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,830
No... No !

152
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,190
Father ! Mother !

153
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:10,750
Li’er, are you watching this ?

154
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:14,270
I'm just getting started !

155
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:19,470
Noooo !!!

156
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:45,710
My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.

157
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,870
You can always come back,

158
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,670
we will always be there for you.

159
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,120
Tie Zhu...

160
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:55,470
you really look like an Immortal now.

161
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:58,950
I have never been so proud in my life.

162
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:08,950
Wang Lin,

163
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,710
I will wait for you

164
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,750
outside the valley in 3 months.

165
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,750
If you don’t show up,

166
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,950
I will make sure that

167
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:20,030
your parents' souls never reincarnate !

168
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:30,310
The Corpse Sect’s Late stage Foundation Establishment Corpse Puppets

169
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,590
were all killed in one strike...

170
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,630
Retreat !

171
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,430
Who’s there ? Don’t interfere !

172
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,350
Die !

173
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:57,150
Father, Mother, I will definitely succeed

174
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,710
in next year's imperial exams.

175
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,670
Silly boy, don’t push yourself so hard.

176
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,070
Father...

177
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:07,830
Mother...

178
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,390
Do you understand now ?

179
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,910
If my cultivation was higher,

180
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:31,480
then even if I slaughtered everyone in Teng Family City,

181
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:35,230
Teng Huayuan wouldn’t dare to say a word.

182
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:37,270
Let alone target my parents.

183
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:40,630
You just broke through a bottleneck by accident

184
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,950
unlocking the Ji Realm.

185
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:44,990
The Ji Realm ?

186
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,070
Ji means extreme.

187
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:50,030
The Ji Realm is the strongest type of cultivation.

188
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:53,030
The Ji Realm will overpower your peers of the same level.

189
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,150
But it also limits the user.

190
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,880
There has never been

191
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,390
a Ji Realm user who has broken through

192
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,720
above the level of Nascent Soul.

193
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:03,030
You won't be able to reach higher levels.

194
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:16,990
A Soul Flag is an artifact made by Nascent Soul cultivators.

195
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,550
It can store souls.

196
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,590
As long as their souls remain,

197
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:22,350
I will revive them

198
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,870
once I get back my cultivation.

199
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,510
Really !?

200
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,430
Yes.

201
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,830
When you inevitably fight Teng Huayuan,

202
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:31,270
just steal the Soul Flag.

203
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,830
I don’t have much energy left.

204
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,350
Maybe 3 teleportations maximum.

205
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:39,230
The Foreign Battlefield will open in 3 months.

206
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,510
After you steal the Soul Flag,

207
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,030
you should try to go there.

208
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,590
Only Foundation Establishment cultivators can enter it.

209
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:52,950
If we go there, I will have time to recover.

210
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,190
You're right Senior,

211
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:58,950
I don't have enough time.

212
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:05,520
3 months later

213
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:23,590
It’s you...

214
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,720
What do you want ?

215
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,430
Hand over all your tokens

216
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:29,590
or else...

217
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,150
die !

218
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,390
The Piao Miao Sect forfeits.

219
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,390
When the valley opens,

220
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:40,830
we’ll leave immediately.

221
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:55,910
Who has the last token ?

222
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:58,110
Liu Mei has it.

223
00:15:58,320 --> 00:16:01,150
Liu Mei used me to distract the other sects

224
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:03,920
and ensure the Xuan Dao Sect keeps the last token.

225
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:07,350
If you spare me,

226
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,110
I’ll take you to Liu Mei !

227
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:18,390
I just want your token, not your lives.

228
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:22,790
Foundation Establishment ?

229
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,550
Thank you for sparing me.

230
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:47,270
The Foreign Battlefield cleanup

231
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:51,230
is a crucial trial of the cultivation world.

232
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:54,830
All of the Sect Ancestors are outside the valley,

233
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:57,670
including Teng Huayuan.

234
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:02,870
This concentrated Ji Realm cold energy is my best bet.

235
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,030
There are 7 tokens

236
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:14,110
so you should destroy 6

237
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:17,270
just to be absolutely sure.

238
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:20,710
Now, I just have one last thing to do.

239
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:41,870
Wang Lin, you have nowhere left to run !

240
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,950
This will be fun to watch...

241
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:12,430
Teng Huayuan !

242
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:26,640
I've been walking this path for endless years

243
00:18:23,300 --> 00:18:26,640
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

244
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:32,240
Is it the compass of fate

245
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:32,240
that wrote this outcome for us ?

246
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:38,160
The heavens want to erase your existence,

247
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:43,880
that's the obsession guiding me.

248
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:49,480
Is this the path to uncover

249
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:49,480
truths from falsehoods ?

250
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:55,080
In a world of murk and shadow,

251
00:18:51,660 --> 00:18:55,080
only the flame of truth can light the way.

252
00:18:55,120 --> 00:19:00,800
Look at them all,

253
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:00,800
being carried by the waves.

254
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:05,440
Look at them all,

255
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:05,440
being drowned.

256
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:08,760
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

257
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:11,840
I will let the world refine my soul.

258
00:19:11,970 --> 00:19:17,400
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

259
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:17,400
I will fight.

260
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:20,520
I'll break through the abyss of despair

261
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:23,560
to finally learn who I really am.

262
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:28,920
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

263
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:28,920
I embrace this obsession.

264
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:31,880
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

265
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:34,680
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

266
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:40,160
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

267
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:40,160
I'll still fight.

268
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:43,520
It's hard to avoid loneliness

269
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:46,560
when you are above everyone else.

270
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:52,240
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

271
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:52,240
be afraid of a firefly ?
